Manifest-Version: 1.0
Bundle-Version: 6.3.0.r
X-Bundle-Update-Library: true
X-Bundle-Update-Library-Info: Fixed the error messages of invalid regular expressions in the synchronize editors.\nFixed masks longer than 10 characters of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.\nFixed the commands STRPREPRC and BUILD for a library with another name.
X-Bundle-Info: Fixed the time of the last change in the iSphere Synchronize Stream Files editor.\nFixed the extra message 'Operation has been canceled by the user.' after an error in the synchronize editors.\nFixed the error 'Compute launch button tooltip' of the synchronize editors opened with one side only.\nFixed special characters in the data area editor; the data queue monitor and the Journal Explorer.\nFixed the line breaks of error messages.
X-Beta-Version: 6.3.0.r
X-Beta-Update-Library: true
X-Beta-Update-Library-Info: Fixed the error messages of invalid regular expressions in the synchronize editors.\nFixed masks longer than 10 characters of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.\nFixed the commands STRPREPRC and BUILD for a library with another name.
X-Beta-Info: Fixed the time of the last change in the iSphere Synchronize Stream Files editor.\nFixed the extra message 'Operation has been canceled by the user.' after an error in the synchronize editors.\nFixed the error 'Compute launch button tooltip' of the synchronize editors opened with one side only.\nFixed special characters in the data area editor; the data queue monitor and the Journal Explorer.\nFixed the line breaks of error messages.
